        "quote": "As used herein, the term “park” or “cause to be parked” means the standing of a vehicle, whether occupied or not, otherwise than temporarily for the purpose of and while actually engaged in loading or unloading property or passengers or while engaged in residential or commercial construction or repair work. (Ord. 17851 § 1, 6-11-02. Code 1981 § 43-533. Code 1995 § 142-581.)",
